# Simplified Chinese. Machine translated. See es.ftl for the review note: the
# strings that delete, empty or discard are what a native reviewer should read
# first.
#
# No plural select expressions, for the same reason as ja.ftl: Chinese has one
# grammatical number and CLDR gives it only `other`.
#
# Anything absent falls back to English rather than showing an id, so an
# incomplete file is safe to ship. A wrong one is not.

